===Etymology===
A variant of {{m|en|hunteress}}, from {{inh|en|enm|hunteras}}, {{m|enm|hunteres}}, {{m|enm|hunteresse}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|hunter|ess}}, possibly on the model of the likes of {{m|en|mistress}}.

